{"notebook":"nb1","page":1,"seed":1,"says":"I am starting by drawing the pencil itself at life size down the right edge of the page, with a tick at the place where I will have to stop. Beside it, a few plain lines saying what this notepad is going to be: one desk, one window, one day, written down as the pencil gets shorter. I want the first page to be quiet and exact. The measuring comes before the spending.","before":{"length":175,"worn":0.010522196030317836,"eraser":12,"sharpenings":0,"graphite":0,"distance":0},"after":{"length":174.45424951398033,"worn":0.06647849457885188,"eraser":12,"sharpenings":0,"graphite":0.0559562985485341,"distance":3382.235408766473},"stats":{"strokeM":3.382235408766473,"graphite":0.0559562985485341,"used":0.5457504860196707,"sharpenings":0,"erasedMm2":0,"coverage":0.0025719938675218238,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"Half a Pencil","size":12,"x":14,"y":22,"pressure":1.1},{"op":"write","text":"This is the pencil, drawn life size, on the morning it was new. 175 mm from the eraser to the point.","x":14,"y":40,"width":78},{"op":"write","text":"I get to use it down to the tick marked HALF and then I have to stop, wherever I am.","x":14,"width":78},{"op":"write","text":"So: a notepad about one desk, one window, one day. Nothing wasted, nothing saved.","x":14,"width":78},{"op":"curve","points":[[118.4,24],[118.4,19.5],[122,18],[125.6,19.5],[125.6,24]]},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[118.4,19,7.2,5]},"angle":45,"spacing":0.7,"pressure":0.5},{"op":"rect","x":118.4,"y":24,"w":7.2,"h":11},{"op":"line","x1":118.4,"y1":26,"x2":125.6,"y2":26},{"op":"line","x1":118.4,"y1":27.5,"x2":125.6,"y2":27.5},{"op":"line","x1":118.4,"y1":31.5,"x2":125.6,"y2":31.5},{"op":"line","x1":118.4,"y1":33,"x2":125.6,"y2":33},{"op":"line","x1":118.4,"y1":35,"x2":118.4,"y2":176},{"op":"line","x1":125.6,"y1":35,"x2":125.6,"y2":176},{"op":"line","x1":120.8,"y1":35,"x2":120.8,"y2":174,"pressure":0.5},{"op":"line","x1":123.2,"y1":35,"x2":123.2,"y2"